OL,3,AEarly morning police raids target
OL,4,Aorganised crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men also died when their
OL,7,FVolkswagen Passat went the wrong way
OL,8,Fdown the road and hit a Cleveland
OL,9,FPolice armed response vehicle heading
OL,10,Fin the opposite direction.
